{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22849","headline":"春末夏初闲游江郭二首 二 · 白居易","name":"春末夏初闲游江郭二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳影繁初合，莺声涩渐稀。\n早梅迎夏结，残絮送春飞。\n西日韶光尽，南风暑气微。\n展张新小簟，熨帖旧生衣。\n绿蚁杯香嫩，红丝脍缕肥。\n故园无此味，何必苦思归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}